# === Verible Linter Configuration ===
# Applied globally to the project

# --- Formatting & Style ---
+line-length=length:120     # Standard modern line length (default is usually 100)
-no-tabs                    # Disable if you have legacy code or Xilinx files with tabs
+generate-label             # Enforce labels on generate blocks (helps with debugging)

# --- Best Practices ---
+always-comb                # Enforce using always_comb instead of always @* in SV
+always-ff-non-blocking     # Enforce non-blocking (<=) assignments in sequential logic
+module-begin-block         # Require begin/end blocks inside modules for readability
-macro-name-style           # Disabled: Allows both uppercase and lowercase macros

# --- Naming Conventions ---
+parameter-name-style=localparam_style:CamelCase
